# The office's calendar: closed at weekends and on the days the module base lists, which this file
# reads by `@base/…`, a path from the root of this module. The days are the test's own.
calendar office v1
description "The office of the tests of modules: closed on Saturdays, Sundays and the days the module base lists"

source closures = file "@base/data/closures.csv" sha256:a9dedfd32fd6e08f
  format csv utf8
  covers 2026-01-01..2027-12-31

closed weekly sat, sun
closed closures
